+---
+id: task-002-monthly-csv-export-of-orders
+type: task
+title: "Monthly CSV export of orders"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+The accountant wants a monthly export of orders for her spreadsheet.
+
+- `OrderBook.exportMonth(month)`, month as `YYYY-MM`: CSV text, a header line then one line per order
+  placed in that month, by order number.
+- Columns: `order`, `date` (as stored), `customer` (name), `total` (what the customer
+  pays, discount and shipping included, euros with two decimals).
+- No email or phone: the export must not carry customers' contact details (rejection of the first version).
+- Values with a comma, quote or line break are quoted, quotes doubled. No orders: header line alone.
+- Lines are joined with `\n`, no trailing newline. A malformed month gives the header alone.
